# Build-time environment for the Reachy Mini mobile app.
#
# Vite exposes any variable prefixed with `VITE_` to the client bundle
# via `import.meta.env.VITE_*`. Copy this file to `.env.local` and
# fill in the values you need; `.env.local` is gitignored so secrets
# stay on your machine.

# OpenAI Realtime API key.
# REQUIRED for the in-app voice conversation (orb / live view inside
# `<ConversationPanel>`). Without it, the conversation engine falls
# through to a "ready but silent" state: the WebRTC tunnel to the
# robot is up, motors engage, but no AI voice and no tool calls.
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Override the HF central signaling Space.
# Defaults to the production tfrere instance the fleet currently
# registers against. Useful when developing against a staging
# central or a self-hosted relay.
# VITE_REACHY_CENTRAL_URL=https://tfrere-reachy-mini-central.hf.space
